Body:
would it be possible to respect this standard in package.json? ([mentioned here](https://pnpm.io/11.x/package_json#devenginespackagemanager))

```json
  "devEngines": {
    "packageManager": {
      "name": "bun",
      "version": ">=1.13.0",
      "onFail": "error"
    }
  }
```

I tried that but OpenCode/arborist just ignored it.

It's really weird because when I develop plugins/hooks I use bun - which I much prefer to npm/node, but then opencode would still force `npm` on me which creates a conflict
